  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF8- Enabling the transition to a Blue and Green Economy in the Seychelles PIMS 9533</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project delivers global environmental benefits by reducing CO2 emissions, improving food security, and advancing nature-positive action across tourism, food, and urban sectors. It leverages innovative financial mechanisms and ecosystem service valuations to upscale NbS restoration, capture blue carbon, and drive sustainable investments. Through knowledge sharing, collaborative engagement, and integrated monitoring, it empowers economies and builds partnerships at regional and global levels</narrative>
  </description>
